<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 25 pct of Svyazinvest in 1997.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 25 pct of Svyazinvest in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia intends to auction 25 percent of state telecoms holding company Svyazinvest this year at a starting price of $1.1 billion, privatisation minister Alfred Kokh said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
